* Fixed the macOS patch policies for the 4K YouTube to MP3, 4K Video to MP3, 4K Video Downloader, 4K Stogram, and 4K Slideshow Maker Fleet-maintained apps always failing on up-to-date hosts. These apps report only `major.minor` as their `CFBundleShortVersionString` (`26.3` for 4K YouTube to MP3 `26.3.5`), so the policies now compare `CFBundleVersion`, which carries the full version.
* Fixed the 4K Video Downloader Fleet-maintained app for macOS using the wrong bundle identifier (`com.4kdownload.ApplicationDirectories` instead of `com.openmedia.4kvideodownloader`), which kept Fleet from detecting the installed app and kept the install script from quitting and relaunching it.
